 "Clay enriches the business, finds the owner, then runs three email providers in order until one returns a verified address.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_59", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2478, "y": 62, "width": 1686, "height": 448, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1128488134, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1210883261, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_60", "type": "text", "x": 2500, "y": 78, "width": 1642, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17581914, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 625675343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - QUALIFY AND PERSONALIZE", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - QUALIFY AND PERSONALIZE", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_61", "type": "text", "x": 2500, "y": 114, "width": 1642, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1799361520, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1585932014, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Claude reads their site and Google profile, scores the fit, and writes the first line off what it actually found.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Claude reads their site and Google profile, scores the fit, and writes the first line off what it actually found.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_62", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4362, "y": -42, "width": 352, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1368426742, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 538981927, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_63", "type": "text", "x": 4384, "y": -26, "width": 308, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 231897702, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1961269854, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - INTO THE CAMPAIGN", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - INTO THE CAMPAIGN", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_64", "type": "text", "x": 4384, "y": 9, "width": 308, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1685254564, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1709696036, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The lead lands in the campaign for its\nsegment with the variables already filled,\nand the follow-ups run on schedule.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "b